<BaseLayout
  title={"The JIN Experience — Downtown Dubai"}
  description={"Discover the intimate counter experience at JIN in Downtown Dubai."}
  ogDescription={"Discover the intimate counter experience at JIN in Downtown Dubai."}
  canonicalPath={"/experience.html"}
  stylesheet={"/inner.css"}
  script={"/inner.js"}
  active={"experience"}
>
<main id="main">
<section class="inner-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
  <div class="inner-hero-media"><img src="/assets/experience-hero.webp" alt="JIN omakase counter during an intimate evening service" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" width="1600" height="1000"></div>
  <div class="inner-hero-scrim"></div>
  <div class="inner-hero-content"><p class="hero-meta">The experience · Downtown Dubai</p><h1 id="page-title">Every seat is <em>part of the story.</em></h1><p class="hero-copy">The distance between chef and guest disappears. At JIN, an evening unfolds in gestures, conversation, and courses made for the moment.</p><a class="hero-scroll" href="#story">Explore <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
  <p class="hero-page">Experience</p>
</section>
<section class="section-space page-wrap" id="story"><div class="intro-grid"><h2 class="display-heading reveal">Close enough to <em>feel every gesture.</em></h2><div class="intro-copy reveal reveal-delay"><p>The counter is the heart of JIN. It turns dinner into a shared rhythm: the sound of a knife on wood, the warmth of rice in the chef’s hand, the pause before a course is placed before you.</p><p>Each seat offers the same clear view and the same invitation to be present.</p><a class="text-link" href="omakase.html">Discover the omakase <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class="mosaic"><figure class="mosaic-a reveal parallax-media"><img src="/assets/chef-hands.webp" alt="Chef working by hand at the counter" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>Made within reach</figcaption></figure><figure class="mosaic-b reveal reveal-delay"><img src="/assets/sake.webp" alt="Sake service with ceramic cup" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>The ritual of arrival</figcaption></figure><figure class="mosaic-c reveal"><img src="/assets/alcove.webp" alt="Private red dining alcove" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>Space for conversation</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="quote-band"><blockquote class="reveal">An evening designed around <em>attention.</em></blockquote><p class="reveal reveal-delay">To the ingredient. To the craft. To the guest across the counter.</p></section>
<section class="section-space page-wrap"><div class="split-story"><figure class="split-media reveal parallax-media"><img src="/assets/interior.webp" alt="JIN red lacquer sushi counter" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>The proposed counter at JIN</figcaption></figure><div class="split-copy reveal reveal-delay"><h2>The room sets <em>the pace.</em></h2><p>Warm lacquer and low amber light soften the world outside. Materials are rich without becoming loud, and every line in the room draws attention back to the counter.</p><h3>Intimacy, without interruption.</h3><p>Service is precise and quietly observant. The room is composed to make a small number of guests feel entirely looked after.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section-space page-wrap field-pale"><div class="intro-grid"><h2 class="display-heading reveal">Small rituals, <em>remembered.</em></h2><div class="intro-copy reveal reveal-delay"><p>The first pour, the placement of a plate, the final piece of nigiri: JIN’s experience lives in details that reveal themselves slowly.</p></div></div><div class="triptych"><figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/chawanmushi.webp" alt="Chawanmushi in a handmade cup" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>Warmth and delicacy</figcaption></figure><figure class="reveal reveal-delay parallax-media"><img src="/assets/otoro-brush.webp" alt="Otoro nigiri brushed with sauce" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>The final gesture</figcaption></figure><figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/nigiri.webp" alt="Nigiri on handmade ceramic" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>One piece at a time</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="next-page"><h2>Next: <em>Omakase</em></h2><a href="omakase.html">Follow the menu →</a></section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
